        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9437625?u=5bae19ad8c52ed12e143d9d463a09a03b6bf7bdb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Switched Firefox to fully supporting <code class=\"notranslate\">::highlight()</code> as of version 149.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <a href=\"https://bugzil.la/1845447\" rel=\"nofollow\">linked bug</a> was fixed in version 149, so if the two listed bugs were the thing making the implementation \"partial\", that no longer applies.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I confirmed that it works in Firefox 149 on macOS with <a href=\"https://codepen.io/editor/cpmsmith/pen/019d9737-e4d8-7dee-a248-b51524519342\" rel=\"nofollow\">this Codepen</a>, which is just a modification of <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Selectors/::highlight#highlighting_characters\" rel=\"nofollow\">this MDN demo</a> with a <code class=\"notranslate\">text-shadow</code> added to one of the highlights:</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/9437625/579393739-bcbaf202-9557-498a-961d-2ac48825f2a1.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..BjMqyuRc1PYdeNsAMBA_LaiDf-2Z1XliW58bMmwernw\"><img width=\"550\" height=\"145\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/9437625/579393739-bcbaf202-9557-498a-961d-2ac48825f2a1.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..BjMqyuRc1PYdeNsAMBA_LaiDf-2Z1XliW58bMmwernw\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 145px;\"></a>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This more or less supersedes <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3586308211\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28375\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28375/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28375\">#28375</a>, which was under some debate concerning this bug, and which is not as important if the bug is fixed.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29498",
            "title": "Firefox 149 fixes bug in CSS `::highlight()` and `text-shadow`",
            "date_modified": "2026-04-16T17:04:11.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-04-16T17:03:38.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "cpmsmith",
                "url": "https://github.com/cpmsmith"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17036061?u=becea1794942100f6fe2be3a310afc188b7bde2e&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add the missing <code class=\"notranslate\">force-end</code> value to the CSS <code class=\"notranslate\">hanging-punctuation</code> property.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-16_4-release-notes#:~:text=Added%20support%20for%20the%20force%2Dend%20value%20of%20the%20hanging%2Dpunctuation%20property.\" rel=\"nofollow\">Safari 16.4 Release Notes</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29497",
            "title": "Add missing force-end value for hanging-punctuation",
            "date_modified": "2026-04-16T14:17:07.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-04-16T14:16:23.000Z",
