        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Overscroll behavior has changed since Chrome 144 and Firefox 150 and stayed the same in Safari.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I would say it deserves the partial implementation flag.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1837436\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1837436</a></li>\n<li>Chrome <a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/41371072\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/41371072</a></li>\n<li>WebKit <a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=243452\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=243452</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4276128310\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43813\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/43813/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43813\">mdn/content#43813</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29496",
            "title": "Overscroll behavior: add partial to Safari and support notes",
            "date_modified": "2026-04-16T13:56:40.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-04-16T13:56:02.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "pepelsbey",
                "url": "https://github.com/pepelsbey"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ships <code class=\"notranslate\">animation-range</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">animation-range-start</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">animation-range-end</code> in Firefox 150</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Bugzilla: <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1825427\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1825427</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Part of the <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4127866744\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43565\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43565/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43565\">mdn/content#43565</a></p>",
